<title>USA: CCC buys 3,870 tonnes U.S. corn for Honduras.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 3,870 tonnes U.S. corn for Honduras.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought 3,870 tonnes of U.S. corn from Cargill Inc for export to Honduras.</p>
<p>The corn was priced at $153.14 a tonne, FOB, for shipment between July 21 and August 20.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
